    "title": "MICROSERVICE_DEV_SIM Swap Management API",
    "description": "The SIM Swap Management API enables the seamless management of SIM card swaps for telecommunications providers. This endpoint allows authorized users to initiate SIM card swaps for customers, facilitating service continuity and ensuring accurate subscriber data. Typical consumers include customer service representatives and automated systems that handle user requests for SIM replacements. By utilizing this API, service providers can enhance customer experience and maintain network integrity while managing user subscriptions effectively.",
